<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets warrants on red chip conglomerates.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets warrants on red chip conglomerates.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Wednesday it has launched 138 million American-style call warrants on a basked of red chip conglomerate stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> China Resources Enterprise Ltd	    0.2  share</p>
<p> China Merchants Hai Hong Holdings Ltd   0.65 share</p>
<p> Guangzhou Investment Co Ltd		 0.6  share</p>
<p> Shum Yip Investment Ltd		     0.8  share</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$14.652	PREMIUM	   18.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.4688	GEARING	   3.47x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  30.APR.98	EXER LOT	  10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	PAYDATE	   19.MAY.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$16.28	 LISTING DATE    21.MAY.97</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT</p>
<p>			 ISSUER'S DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
